# Ask the user for a string that contains both letters and numbers(e.g.,"Py2th0on3") write aprogram that separates them into two lists: 
#one for the letters and one for a numbers.calculate the sum of the numbers found and join the letters to from a word
#example input: Pyth0on3
#example outout:word:Python, sum:5
text= input("enter your text : ")
letters = " "
numbers = 0
for c in text:
    if c.isalpha():
        letters +=c
    elif c.isdigit():
       numbers +=int(c)
print("word:",letters)
print("sum:",numbers)
